The QM vm spawned by llm-agent should do the following:
1. Create a git repository. Changes will be pushed to the repository via ssh.
2. The 'llm-agent' service monitors the git repository.
3. Whenever changes are pushed to the git repository, the corresponding
   branch should be checked out into a directory.
4. A Langchain deep agent is spawned, with said directory as its working
   directory.
5. At present, the agent will be given a dummy task of summarizing the changes
   that happened in the last commit.
